{
  "about": "The order of a bot's chat (#460), as public/unread.js (Unread.order) and the Android app (ChatOrder) draw it. What started a run stands at its startedAt, a steered message at its at, a reply at its run's endedAt; the reply of a run at work is at the bottom, in the order the runs started. Pieces: \"a:<run>\" what started it, \"s:<run>:<i>\" its steered message i, \"r:<run>\" its reply. last: the run whose reply is drawn last (its quick answers stand under it).",
